.Dd August 16, 2026
.Dt PROBE 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm probe
.Nd sample driver that offends no decree
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd device probe
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver attaches to sample devices found on Macs.
.Pp
It arms wake on shutdown
.Pq e.g. Va dev.probe.N.wake=1 .
.Sh HARDWARE
The
.Nm
driver supports:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Sample widget, present on later machines
.Pq 2018 and later .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr acpi 4
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Fx 16.0 .
